    "text": "{\"projectId\":\"8978791379095391159\",\"sessionId\":\"13661896880095741214\",\"outputComponents\":[{\"designSystem\":{\"name\":\"assets/f8866ee186754557aaebd58fd96499a8\",\"designSystem\":{\"displayName\":\"Genius Trader\",\"styleGuidelines\":\"## Brand & Style\\n\\nThis design system crafts an elite, high-focus trading environment for quantitative thinkers and discretionary execution traders. The brand aesthetic merges the spatial fluidity of visionary iOS interface paradigms with the clinical precision of institutional finance. Rather than overwhelming users with noisy, opaque HUDs or cluttered terminals, the interface evokes calm mastery, clarity, and rapid perceptual recognition through ultra-clean frosted glass surfaces, precise typographic rhythm, and deliberate chromatic cues.\\n\\nThe design movement centers on **Minimal Frosted Glass (Spatial iOS Liquid Light)**:\\n- Surfaces behave like hyper-pure silica suspended over dynamic market substrates.\\n- Layering is achieved via variable backdrop filtration, ambient white bounce light, and soft light scatter instead of hard dark outlines or skeletal divider grids.\\n- Visual weight flows dynamically: passive market data settles gracefully into translucent frosted card surfaces, while active controls, high-conviction order entries, and performance milestones hover forward with soft luminous depth.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\n\\nLayout geometry follows an adaptable 8-point spatial rhythm engineered specifically for dense dynamic data streams:\\n\\n- **Mobile Viewport (\\u003c768px)**: Fluid single-column layout anchored with bottom-floating glass dock controls. Outer margin is `1rem` (`16px`) with `0.75rem` gutters between split metric cards. Chart viewing ports break outward to edge-to-edge canvas with inset floating overlays.\\n- **Tablet / Split View (768px - 1024px)**: 8-column layout. Chart module pins to the top 60% of vertical real estate while depth ladders and execution consoles dock into a multi-column modular glass strip.\\n- **Desktop / Ultra-Wide (\\u003e1024px)**: 12-column adaptive workspace. Left analytical lane (3 cols), central primary tape & charting (6 cols), and right quick-execution ladder with performance radar (3 cols). Outer margins scale to `2rem`.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\n\\nVisual hierarchy uses optical translucency, refractive blur, and directional ambient shadows instead of opaque layering or harsh containment lines:\\n\\n- **Level 0 (Market Canvas)**: The base underlying viewport (`#F5F7FA`) host to gridlines, tick graphs, and subtle watermark metadata.\\n- **Level 1 (Docked Panels & Chart Cards)**: `backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%)`; fill `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72)`; ambient shadow `0 8px 32px -4px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.04)`; top highlight `inset 0 1px 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8)`. No dark strokes.\\n- **Level 2 (Floating Action Docks & Modals)**: `backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%)`; fill `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88)`; multi-tiered drop shadow `0 12px 36px -2px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08), 0 4px 12px 0 rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.04)`; subtle inner glow `inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 1.0)`.\\n- **Level 3 (Tactile Push Elements & Dynamic Cursors)**: Focused floating chips, order validation badges, and high-score trophies utilize ambient colored back-glows reflecting their functional color (`#0A84FF` for system focus, `#169873` for winning positions, `#D7355D` for short triggers) rendered at `12%` opacity with a 24px scatter radius.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons & Interactive Triggers\\n- **Primary Order Action (Buy/Long)**: Solid `#169873` fill with white text, micro specular shine across the top edge, and subtle jade drop shadow (`0 8px 20px -2px rgba(22, 152, 115, 0.35)`). Active state applies a scale transform (`0.98`).\\n- **Primary Order Action (Sell/Short)**: Solid `#D7355D` fill with white text and rose shadow (`0 8px 20px -2px rgba(215, 53,
